AspisR1.Port4B_Capacity.read : ∀ (slot cap : Aeneas.Std.Usize) (b k : ℕ),
  b < 2 →
    k < 3 →
      ↑slot = 3 * b + k →
        (Aeneas.Std.Array.make 6#usize [146#usize, 146#usize, 128#usize, 172#usize, 172#usize, 150#usize] ⋯).index_usize
              slot =
            Aeneas.Std.Result.ok cap →
          ↑cap = AspisR1.OraclePortSelectedDraft.capacity (3 * b + k)
'AspisR1.Port4B_Capacity.read' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]
